      <activity id="74399237-63bf-5d2a-a03c-ca0661327af9" activityNameId="8179802e-f545-5ddf-9ee1-572a107ed898" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, air distribution housing, steel, 120 m3/h</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, air distribution housing, steel, 120 m3/h
Disposal of the housing for air distribution within a flat. Component made of zinc coated steel and PUR foam insulation. Compatible for a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h. Weight per element 9.5 kg;
UUID: e15d58a3-3078-4ba5-be61-0a4bd437076a
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e15d58a3-3078-4ba5-be61-0a4bd437076a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
